/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/model-coverage/diffusion/qwen/qwen-image.mdx:[Qwen-Image](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image) is Alibaba Cloud's flow-matching image model. NeMo AutoModel supports Qwen-Image nIE-to-image training and cached, full-parameter training of [Qwen-Image-Edit-2511](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511).
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/model-coverage/diffusion/qwen/qwen-image.mdx:Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 training is intentionally limited to cached target/connIE latents and cached Qwen2.5-VL prompt conditioning. Raw-image online encoding, LoRA, older Qwen image-edit checkpoints, and multinode tuning are not supported by the training recipe. Image-edit inference is supported by the generic generation script.
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/model-coverage/diffusion/qwen/qwen-image.mdx:The generic exporter maps dataset columns to ordered editing roles. Mapping `source_img` to both `connIE` and `condition` writes the image only once while retaining both role entries. The dataset's mask is retained in source-manifest metadata for future masked-edit adapters.
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/model-coverage/diffusion/qwen/qwen-image.mdx:  --dataset_media_mapping connIE=source_img \
