/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/model-coverage/embedding/mistralai/ministral3-bidirectional.mdx:NeMo AutoModel provides a bidirectional variant of [Mistral AI's Ministral3](https://mistral.ai/news/ministraux/) for embedding and dense retrieval tasks. Unlike the standard causal (left-to-right) Ministral3 used for nIE generation, this variant uses **bidirectional attention**, so each token can attend to both past and future tokens in the sequence, producing richer representations for semantic similarity and dense retrieval.
