/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/guides/overview.mdx:This section provides recipes for fine-tuning omni / audio-capable models on automatic speech recognition (ASR) tasks. The recipes reuse the VLM training stack but operate on `{audio, nIE}` HuggingFace datasets (AMI, LibriSpeech, GigaSpeech, CommonVoice, etc.).
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/guides/overview.mdx:Text-to-image and nIE-to-video diffusion models can generate visual content from natural language descriptions. Fine-tuning lets you adapt these models to a specific style, domain, or dataset — for example, generating product videos in your brand's aesthetic. Pretraining gives you full control when no existing model fits your needs.
