/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/guides/llm/dataset.mdx:**Completion datasets** are single nIE sequences designed for language modeling where the model learns to predict the next token given a connIE. These datasets typically contain a connIE (prompt) and a target (completion) that the model should learn to generate.
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/guides/llm/dataset.mdx:- **ConnIE (`ctx`)**: A situation or scenario description
