/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/guides/llm/dataset.mdx:2. **Tokenizes and cleans** the connIE and target separately.
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/guides/llm/dataset.mdx:3. **Concatenates** the connIE and target into one sequence.
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/guides/llm/dataset.mdx:4. **Creates a loss mask** with `-100` for the connIE and target IDs for the target.
