/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/docs/guides/llm/sequence-classification.mdx:Sequence classification tasks (e.g., sentiment analysis, topic classification, GLUE tasks) map input nIE to a discrete label. NeMo AutoModel provides a lightweight recipe specialized for this setting that integrates with popular pretrained model formats and dataset sources. Integration with Hugging Face is supported.
