/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/README.md:- [06/21/2026][**GLM-5.2**](https://huggingface.co/zai-org/GLM-5.2) We now support finetuning `zai-org/GLM-5.2` with IndexShare DSA, optional TileLang sparse kernels, and long-connIE CP recipes. Check out our [32K long-connIE recipe](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Automodel/blob/main/examples/llm_finetune/glm/glm_5.2_tulu3_32k_tilelang_cp8.yaml) and [model coverage page](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Automodel/blob/main/docs/model-coverage/llm/thudm/glm5-moe-dsa.mdx).
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/README.md:- [05/27/2026][**Step-3.7-Flash**](https://huggingface.co/stepfun-ai/Step-3.7-Flash) We added model coverage for Stepfun AI's 198B-A13B MoE vision-language model, targeting image/video agentic developer workflows with a 256k connIE language backbone and 1.8B ViT vision tower. See the [model coverage page](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Automodel/blob/main/docs/model-coverage/vlm/stepfun-ai/step-3-7.md).
/Users/0saker/Desktop/code/probe/all/automodel-2514/README.md:- [04/28/2026][**Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni**](https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni-30B-A3B-Reasoning-BF16) We now support finetuning `nvidia/Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni-30B-A3B-Reasoning-BF16`, NVIDIA's 30B-A3B omnimodal MoE (nIE · image · audio) with NemotronH hybrid Mamba+Attention backbone. Check out our [SFT recipe](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Automodel/blob/main/examples/vlm_finetune/nemotron_omni/nemotron_omni_cord_v2.yaml), [LoRA recipe](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Automodel/blob/main/examples/vlm_finetune/nemotron_omni/nemotron_omni_cord_v2_peft.yaml), and [guide](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Automodel/blob/main/docs/guides/vlm/nemotron-omni.md).
